</details><details class=" accordion  group" aria-expanded="false" is="accordion-disclosure">
  <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><span>What payment gateways do you accept?</span><span class="circle-chevron group-hover:colors group-expanded:colors group-expanded:rotate"><svg role="presentation" focusable="false" width="8" height="6" class="icon icon-chevron-bottom-small" viewBox="0 0 8 6">
